100,000","gen":"int[] a0 = BCB.ints(100000, 1, 1000000000); int a1 = 1000; int a2 = 50;"},"refMs":21}],"lesson":"binary-search-on-answer","statement":"Flower `i` blooms on day `bloomDay[i]` and stays bloomed. To make a bouquet you need `k` adjacent flowers that have all bloomed, and each flower can be used in only one bouquet.\n\nReturn the minimum number of days you must wait to be able to make `m` bouquets, or `-1` if it can never be done.","constraints":["n == bloomDay.length","1 <= n <= 1e5","1 <= bloomDay[i] <= 1e9","1 <= m <= 1e6","1 <= k <= n"],"hints":["If m × k is more than the number of flowers, the answer is −1 immediately (compute it as a long).","Waiting longer never hurts, so binary-search the day between min(bloomDay) and max(bloomDay).","To test a day, scan left to right counting bloomed flowers in a row; every time the run reaches k, make a bouquet and reset the run."],"explain":"Each bouquet needs `k = 1` flower. By day 3 the flowers blooming on days 1, 3 and 2 are open, enough for 3 bouquets. On day 2 only two flowers are open. So the answer is day 3."},
{"slug":"minimum-time-to-complete-trips","title":"Minimum Time to Complete Trips","level":"Medium","summary":"Bus i takes time[i] for one trip and can repeat trips back to back; buses run in parallel. Return the least time for all buses together to finish at least totalTrips trips.","method":"minimumTime","params":[["int[]","time"],["int","totalTrips"]],"returns":"long","tests":[{"in":["[1,2,3]","5"],"out":"3"},{"in":["[2]","1"],"out":"2"},{"in":["[5,10,10]","9"],"out":"25"},{"in":["[10000000]","10000000"],"out":"100000000000000"},{"in":["[3,3,8]","6"],"out":"9"},{"in":["[4272250,10000000,3036962,4084561,5812556,1,4215111,9174620,1603888,5654674,8535593]","6746208"],"out":"6746197","g":1},{"in":["[3666861,10000000]","18"],"out":"50000000","g":1},{"in":["[1,5,4,3]","2451998"],"out":"1374953","g":1},{"in":["[10000000,10000000,10000000,743426]","1"],"out":"743426","g":1},{"in":["[3784953,3739330,3199361,12407]","10000000"],"out":"122783989636","g":1},{"in":["[3,5,4,2,2,1,5,4,1,2,5,3,4,2,5,5,1]","1"],"out":"1","g":1},{"in":["[5,5,5,3,3,2,2,2,1]","6666443"],"out":"1769853","g":1},{"in":["[1,3,3,5,2,2]","1"],"out":"1","g":1},{"in":["[2185381,2185379,2185378]","1"],"out":"2185378","g":1},{"in":["[3,1,5,3,1,4,1,3,3,3]","10000000"],"out":"1954398","g":1},{"in":["[5,3,5,3,4,2,4]","10000000"],"out":"4838712","g":1},{"in":["[5,4,5,3,3,3,1,2,5,1]","10000000"],"out":"2298852","g":1},{"in":["[5,1,3,2]","10000000"],"out":"4918034","g":1},{"in":["[1]","1"],"out":"1","g":1},{"in":["[4,4]","10000000"],"out":"20000000","g":1},{"in":["[1,3,2,3,4,5,2,1,4,2,2,5,1,3,3]","21"],"out":"4","g":1},{"in":["[1]","14"],"out":"14","g":1},{"in":["[1703909,8250284,1940581,1,4712543,4400994,2552561]","10"],"out":"10","g":1},{"in":["[1,1,1,1,5]","8301390"],"out":"1976522","g":1},{"in":["[4005258,458716,1727519,1,10000000,1,9191949,5646097]","1"],"out":"1","g":1},{"in":["[3]","5"],"out":"15","g":1},{"in":["[1,7869845]","7"],"out":"7","g":1},{"in":["[6489325]","10000000"],"out":"64893250000000","g":1},{"in":["[9290286,9805945]","9762848"],"out":"46574414806068","g":1},{"in":["[3,1,1,4,4,1,4,3,5,5,3]","10000000"],"out":"1941748","g":1},{"in":["[110185]","1"],"out":"110185","g":1},{"in":["[1]","10000000"],"out":"10000000","g":1},{"in":["[218746,218749,218744,218744,218744,218748,218744,218745,218744,218747,218747,218748,218743,218745,218745,218749,218745,218746,218743]","1"],"out":"218743","g":1},{"in":["[1990829,6336085]","1"],"out":"1990829","g":1},{"in":["[8220477,10000000]","1"],"out":"8220477","g":1},{"in":["[4,1,3]","4857763"],"out":"3068061","g":1},{"in":["[2,4,2,2,2]","29"],"out":"14","g":1},{"in":["[1,3]","1"],"out":"1","g":1},{"in":["[2965751,2965751,2965752,2965752,2965752,2965752]","1"],"out":"2965751","g":1},{"in":["[3,1,4,3,5,2,2,4,5,1,1]","2329824"],"out":"418532","g":1},{"in":["[3083585,4239853,4239853,3083585,4239853,4239853,3083585,4239853,4239853,3083585]","3395562"],"out":"1251897155457","g":1},{"in":["[5,3,1,5,1,5,2,1,1,1]","10000000"],"out":"1554405","g":1},{"in":["[2,2,4,2,4]","29"],"out":"16","g":1},{"in":["[1276425]","1"],"out":"1276425","g":1},{"in":["[2981898,2981899]","4656475"],"out":"6942568235724","g":1},{"in":[],"out":"\"#8:7ae2a903f0d9a377\"","perf":{"label":"100,000 buses, 10⁷ trips","gen":"int[] a0 = BCB.ints(100000, 1, 10000000); int a1 = 10000000;"},"refMs":7}],"lesson":"binary-search-on-answer","statement":"Bus `i` needs `time[i]` units of time for one trip and can start its next trip as soon as it finishes. All buses run at the same time, independently.\n\nReturn the minimum time needed for the buses together to complete at least `totalTrips` trips.","constraints":["1 <= time.length <= 1e5","1 <= time[i] <= 1e7","1 <= totalTrips <= 1e7"],"hints":["By time T, bus i has completed T / time[i] trips (integer division).","The total trips grow as T grows, so binary-search the smallest T with sum(T / time[i]) ≥ totalTrips.","The upper bound is min(time) × totalTrips, which needs a long. Stop summing early once you reach totalTrips to avoid overflow."],"explain":"In 3 units of time the buses finish 3 ÷ 1 = 3, 3 ÷ 2 = 1 and 3 ÷ 3 = 1 trips (rounded down), 5 in total. In 2 units they finish only 2 + 1 + 0 = 3 trips. So the minimum time is 3."},
